h","value":"v_{J1}=\\frac{x_{KB}}{t}=10m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{J1}=m_{1}v_{J1}=10kg\\cdot m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n解法2"},{"type":"math","value":"t' = \\sqrt{\\frac{2R}{g}}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{J2}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{x_{\\mathrm{KB}}^2 + R^2}}{t'} = \\sqrt{194}\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {\\mathrm{J2}} = m _ {1} v _ {\\mathrm{J2}} = \\sqrt {1 9 4} \\mathrm{kg} \\cdot \\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n(其他合理解法也给 2 分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2611-q17","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2611","source_question_id":"jiaxing-yimo-2611-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"b3013d9ac91a959043bf1aa8cd5e969a04ed82bb6b69a514d3b8caf6af96031e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）某兴趣小组针对原子结构开展了如下研究。\n（1）项目一：如图甲所示，真空玻璃管内阴极 K 发出的电子流在 K 与阳极 A 间加速后，平行于两极板 C、D 进入极板间。若 C、D 间无电压，电子将打在荧光屏上 O 点。在 C、D 间加电压 U=288V，电子打在荧光屏上的 P 点；再在 C、D 间加垂直于纸面、磁感应强度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"B=6\\times10^{-4}T"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场，电子又打在荧光屏上 O 点。已知 C、D 的长度 L=6cm、间距 d=1.5cm，C、D 右端到荧光屏的距离 s=12cm，O、P 间距离 y=3cm。\n①判断 C、D 间所加磁场方向（垂直纸面“向内”或“向外”）；\n②电子的比荷（保留2位有效数字）；\n③若撤去 C、D 间电压，但保留磁场，利用该装置设计另一种测电子比荷的方案，列出所需测定的物理量，并给出比荷的表达式。\n（2）项目二：已知点电荷电势表达式 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi=k\\frac{Q}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":" （点电荷带电量 Q，到点电荷距离 r，取无穷远处电势为零），静电力常量 "},{"type":"math","value":"k=9.0\\times10^{9}N\\cdot m^{2}/C^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，元电荷 "},{"type":"math","value":"e=1.6\\times10^{-19}C"},{"type":"text","value":" ，请结合图乙的氢原子能级图，计算氢原子处于 n=2 的激发态时电子的轨道半径 r（保留 2位有效数字）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/192c2aee4b44be39c51226a3a55126cb4cadf4ae338169095fcd0645390ea829.png","width":876,"height":273,"width_mm":102.867,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2611-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图甲 测定电子比荷的实验装置\n第17题图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a379ed26a265126b7274fee2284779d5ce0aff4f2702b79f72730070e396e05d.png","width":288,"height":401,"width_mm":33.721,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2611-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图乙 氢原子能级图\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （1）①根据左手定则，磁感应强度方向 垂直于纸面向内 （1 分）\n②根据平衡方程："},{"type":"math","value":"qvB=\\frac{U}{d}q"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分） 可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{U}{Bd}=3.2\\times10^{7}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"根据几何关系："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Y}{\\frac{L}{2}}=\\frac{y}{\\frac{L}{2}+s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分） 可得："},{"type":"math","value":"Y=\\frac{yL}{L+2s}=0.6cm"},{"type":"text","value":"根据竖直分运动位移与时间关系："},{"type":"math","value":"Y=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{Uq}{dm}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{L}{v}\\right)^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n可得："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{q}{m} = 1.8\\times 10^{11}\\mathrm{C / kg}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n③参考方案：磁偏转法\n电子经电压 U 加速后，垂直进入匀强磁场 B 做圆周运动，测量运动半径 r，\n结合动能定理与向心力公式，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{e}{m} = \\frac{2U}{B^2r^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n（2）根据圆周运动动力学公式："},{"type":"math","value":"k\\frac{e^{2}}{r^{2}}=m\\frac{v^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\sqrt{\\frac{ke^{2}}{rm}}"},{"type":"text","value":"根据动能表达式："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k}=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k}=k\\frac{e^{2}}{2r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n结合电势表达式："},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi=k\\frac{Q}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p}=-k\\frac{e^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n根据能量守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"E=E_{k}+E_{p}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"E=-k\\frac{e^{2}}{2r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n结合氢原子能级图："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{2}=-k\\frac{e^{2}}{2r}=-3.4eV"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"r=2.1\\times10^{-10}m"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2611-q18","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--jiaxing-yimo-2611","source_question_id":"jiaxing-yimo-2611-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"54a661442e9f82d9f9334a510e757c3bc411809cc3a1baa5563b4ad8b7878d90","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）如图甲所示装置位于光滑水平面和倾角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 的光滑斜面上。磁场发生器 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 在斜面上重物牵引下可沿固定在水平面上的光滑直轨道滑行。 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 和轨道两侧对称安装6个半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3L}{2\\pi}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的转轮，轮轴连线构成两个正三角形。装置所配的每根皮带都嵌入了18根长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 、质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" 的金属棒，金属棒间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 。皮带有两种型号如图乙所示，I型皮带内部每两根金属棒两端由两根短导线连通；II型皮带内部所有金属棒两端通过两根长导线连通。转轮转动时，每个转轮给皮带的阻力 "},{"type":"math","value":"f"},{"type":"text","value":" 与皮带速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"f = kv"},{"type":"text","value":" （ "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" 为未知常数），皮带不打滑。 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 是边长 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 的正方体，开启 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 时仅在其两侧面正对的皮带面上产生垂直于皮带且磁感应强度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场。已知斜面上重物质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 。除上述各部分电阻和质量外，不计其余部分电阻和质量。\n（1）P 两侧都安装I型皮带，开启 P 分别实施两种操作。操作 1 中锁住转轮，操作 2 中解锁转轮。P 在重物牵引下最终都匀速运动且速度之比为 1:2，求：\n①皮带受到的安培力方向（与 P 运动 “同向” 或 “反向”）\n②操作 1 中 P 匀速运动的速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n③k 的值。\n（2）转轮 Q 所在一侧安装Ⅱ型皮带，另一侧安装Ⅰ型皮带，解锁转轮并开启 P，求在重物牵引下皮带与 P 最终都匀速运动时两种皮带的焦耳热功率之比。\n（3）在（2）中，皮带与 P 都匀速运动时关闭 P，同时在Ⅱ型皮带与 Q 接触部分添加辐向磁场如图丙。两种型号皮带前进相同路程后停下，求辐向磁场在皮带位置的磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/912e039f3c58ef0baa2b247aeae753e91555bc7ccfd708a2cc884875c83bcc37.png","width":759,"height":750,"width_mm":89.253,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2611-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/fde8a50104fc2a1a6085715bea0ff5d1a113b72b06f76b6b643d2c0414be99cf.png","width":450,"height":432,"width_mm":52.917,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2611-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/01185c44bba13f86f2d6a55599f1c5f273bc808484f17e5eb3c5fb8c113f35a1.png","width":327,"height":402,"width_mm":38.453,"row_group":"jiaxing-yimo-2611-q18-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图丙\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数：重力加速度g均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (1) ①与"},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":"运动“同向”\n②皮带锁定时，根据平衡方程："},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin\\theta=2B_{1}\\cdot\\frac{B_{1}Lv_{m1}}{2r}\\cdot L"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m1}=\\frac{mgr\\sin\\theta}{B_{1}^{2}L^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"③皮带解锁时，以皮带为对象，根据平衡方程："},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin\\theta=2\\times3kv_{\\text{皮}}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{皮}=\\frac{mg\\sin\\theta}{6k}"},{"type":"text","value":"以连接体为对象，根据平衡方程："},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin\\theta=2B_{1}\\cdot\\frac{B_{1}L(v_{m2}-v_{皮})}{2r}\\cdot L"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m2}-v_{皮}=v_{m1}"},{"type":"text","value":"结合："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{\\mathrm{m1}}}{v_{\\mathrm{m2}}} = \\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"k=\\frac{B_{1}^{2}L^{2}}{6r}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n（2）以整体为研究对象，根据平衡方程："},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin\\theta=3kv_{皮I}+3kv_{皮II}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\text {可得:} v_ {\\text {皮I}} + v_ {\\text {皮II}} = \\frac {2 m g r \\sin \\theta}{B _ {1} ^ {2} L ^ {2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n以皮带1为研究对象，根据平衡方程："},{"type":"math","value":"3kv_{\\text{皮I}} = B_1 \\cdot \\frac{B_1 L(v_m - v_{\\text{皮I}})}{2r} \\cdot L"},{"type":"text","value":"以皮带2为研究对象，根据平衡方程："},{"type":"math","value":"3kv_{\\text{皮II}} = B_1\\cdot \\frac{B_1L(v_m - v_{\\text{皮II}})}{\\frac{18}{17}r}\\cdot L"},{"type":"math","value":"\\text {可得:} \\frac {v_ {\\text {皮I}}}{v_ {\\text {皮II}}} = \\frac {1 3}{1 7}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{综上可得:} v _ {\\mathrm{皮I}} = \\frac {1 3 m g r \\sin \\theta}{1 5 B _ {1} ^ {2} L ^ {2}} \\quad v _ {\\mathrm{皮II}} = \\frac {1 7 m g r \\sin \\theta}{1 5 B _ {1} ^ {2} L ^ {2}} \\quad v _ {\\mathrm{m}} = \\frac {2 6 m g r \\sin \\theta}{1 5 B _ {1} ^ {2} L ^ {2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\text {根据热功率表达式:解法} 1 \\quad P _ {\\text {热I}} = \\frac {B _ {1} ^ {2} L ^ {2} \\left(v _ {\\mathrm{m}} - v _ {\\text {皮1}}\\right) ^ {2}}{2 r} \\quad P _ {\\text {热II}} = \\frac {B _ {1} ^ {2} L ^ {2} \\left(v _ {\\mathrm{m}} - v _ {\\text {皮2}}\\right) ^ {2}}{\\frac {1 8}{1 7} r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{可得:} \\frac {P _ {\\mathrm{热I}}}{P _ {\\mathrm{热II}}} = \\frac {1 6 9}{1 5 3}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\text {解法} 2 \\quad P _ {\\text {热I}} = 3 k v _ {\\text {皮I}} (v _ {\\mathrm{m}} - v _ {\\text {皮I}}) \\quad P _ {\\text {热II}} = 3 k v _ {\\text {皮II}} (v _ {\\mathrm{m}} - v _ {\\text {皮II}})"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{可得:} \\frac {P _ {\\mathrm{热I}}}{P _ {\\mathrm{热II}}} = \\frac {1 6 9}{1 5 3}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n(3) ①以皮带1为研究对象，根据动量定理："},{"type":"math","value":"-3\\sum kv\\cdot\\Delta t=0-18m\\cdot v_{\\text{皮I}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n以皮带2为研究对象，根据动量定理："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\sum B_{2}\\cdot \\frac{B_{2}Lv}{\\frac{18}{17}r}\\cdot L\\cdot \\Delta t - 3\\sum kv\\cdot \\Delta t = 0 - 18m\\cdot v_{\\text{皮II}}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\text {可得:} B _ {2} = \\frac {6}{\\sqrt {2 2 1}} B _ {1} {\\approx} 0. 4 B _ {1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n(1 分)"}]}}]}
